      "id": "claim_b84ca73fa9ca440eaddd035980a5842f",
      "statement": "A thread's durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in thread metadata, read from the live thread never from run config, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` is a worker-local map of stable per-thread proxies; metadata lookup returns {} on failure so no sandbox_id key exists rather than exposing stale IDs.",
